      "writtenOn": "2026-09-24T00:58:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s suppose we have\n```\nsrc/\n  .rustfmt.toml\n  subdir/\n    .rustfmt.toml\n    other_file.rs\n    my_filel.rs\n```\n\nIt feels easier to just copy a relevant subtree into a temporary directory and format that:\n```\ndef format(repo_root: Path, rel_path: Path):\n    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as td:\n        tmp \u003d td.path()\n        (tmp / rel_path).parent.mkdir(parents\u003dTrue)\n        (tmp / rel_path).write((repo_root / rel_path).read_bytes())\n        subdir \u003d rel_path.parent\n        while subdir.parent !\u003d subdir:\n           orig \u003d repo_root / subdir / \u0027.rustfmt.toml\u0027\n           if orig.exists():\n               (tmp / subdir / \u0027.rustfmt.toml\u0027).write(orig.read_bytes())\n           # run formatter\n```",
      "revId": "735b2167934a0a01b061b1ea1868bbebbd3bb04d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
